Regarding your question about the importance of testing in AI research, it's a good one! Testing is an essential part of any scientific investigation, as it helps us determine whether our hypothesis is supported by the data and whether our methods are valid. In AI research, testing involves using various datasets to evaluate the performance of different algorithms and models, and comparing their results to human-level performance.

